# Who reviews the files that decide what CI runs, what a build or a test session executes, and what coding agents are
# told. GitHub requests a review from the owner for a pull request that touches them; with "Require review from Code
# Owners" in the branch rules, one is required. scripts/check_pr_security.py lists the same kinds of file as `review`.

# CI, and the checks that back it
/.github/                          @ItsNotRexed
/scripts/check_pr_security.py      @ItsNotRexed
/scripts/check_no_game_data.py     @ItsNotRexed
/tests/test_check_pr_security.py   @ItsNotRexed

# Fetched or run by the build and the tests
/.gitmodules                       @ItsNotRexed
/.gitattributes                    @ItsNotRexed
/third_party/                      @ItsNotRexed
/tests/requirements.txt            @ItsNotRexed
conftest.py                        @ItsNotRexed
*.ps1                              @ItsNotRexed

# What coding agents and contributors are told to do
/AGENTS.md                         @ItsNotRexed
/CONTRIBUTING.md                   @ItsNotRexed
